    "body": "<!-- claude-projects-attribution: {\"github_login\":\"siainbuletin\"} -->\n_Requested by **Sia**_\n\n**Before:** box titles (\"General agenda\", \"Thesis\", ...) were the same size as the rows, TODO keywords in the boxes had no colour, and the agenda buttons opened the regular `org-agenda`.\n\n**After:**\n- **Titles larger:** new `sp-dashboard-heading-face`, a level 1 heading of the sp themes (colour from `fg-heading-1`, height from `sp-theme-headings`). The label is measured in pixels and the gap before the key is one exact-width space, so the right edge of each box stays straight; a label too wide is cut with an ellipsis. The icon is followed by one space in these titles. Menu blocks (Config, Notes) have the same titles.\n- **TODO keywords coloured** by the face Org uses (`org-todo-keyword-faces`, else `org-todo` / `org-done`). Following the sp-themes design from #89, `sp-theme-engine` gets two roles, `fg-todo` (red) and `fg-done` (green), and maps `org-todo`, `org-done` and the new heading face to them, so every theme and flavor carries it. Only the keyword is coloured; TAB still stops once per entry, and the bullet and keyword are clickable through a keymap.\n- **`org-other-agenda`** replaces `org-agenda-list` for all four agenda buttons. The files are bound for the call and kept buffer-locally in `org-other-agenda-settings` so refreshing keeps them; deadlines are one agenda block of the next `sp-dashboard-deadlines-days` days. General agenda no longer opens the agenda workspace. Without the package it falls back to `org-agenda-list`.\n- Doc and CHANGELOG updated.\n\n**Checked:** Emacs 29.3 headless (layout, TAB, privacy/Focus, clicking a TODO) and a real GUI under a virtual X display, where titles are larger, coloured and aligned, TODO keywords red. **Not checked:** `org-other-agenda` itself (it and its dependencies `textui` and `embark` could not be installed in the container, so only the fallback ran), the real theme colours (I set the faces by hand to the theme values), a Mac or 4K display.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code/session_01T2BcMQ3qdNUiW5oZRLQRsG)_",
